{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Inherited from "},{"code":"Sequence.Element","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" = [","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/element"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/Element"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Type Alias","symbolKind":"typealias","remoteSource":{"fileName":"MaximalCliques.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques.swift#L260"},"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"typealias"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Element"}],"modules":[{"name":"Cliques"}],"externalID":"s:7Cliques07MaximalA0V7Elementa","title":"MaximalCliques.Element","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Element"}]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques/Element":{"title":"MaximalCliques.Element","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Element","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/Element","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/element","type":"topic"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques":{"url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MaximalCliques"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"MaximalCliques","abstract":[{"text":"Every maximal clique of an undirected graph’s simple graph once, lazily, each in ","type":"text"},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"order (by vertex index): an isolated vertex, or one whose only edges are loops, is a clique of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one. The order is Eppstein–Löffler–Strash’s: by the cliques’ first vertex in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", then as Bron–Kerbosch with Tomita’s pivot (ties to the least","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"index) and branches in ascending index meets them. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"degeneracy d.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MaximalCliques"}]},"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/Graph/Vertex":{"fragments":[{"text":"associatedtype","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","title":"Vertex","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/graphprotocols\/graph\/vertex","abstract":[],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques":{"abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","url":"\/documentation\/cliques","role":"collection","title":"Cliques"}}}